  "analysis_md": "因为 $x'|_{t=1}=2te^{2t}+2t^2e^{2t}=4e^2$，$y'|_{t=1}=e^{2t}+2te^{2t}=3e^2$，$z'|_{t=1}=2te^{2t}=2e^2$，则切向量为：\n\n$(4e^2,3e^2,2e^2)$，取 $(4,3,2)$，又 $yOz$ 平面所对应的法向量为：$(1,0,0)$，所以\n\n$$\\sin\\varphi=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{4^2+3^2+2^2}}=\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{29}}.$$",
